# When something is wrong: their dead, their fear, what they have heard of
# how you fight, the men you spared and the men you cut down begging.

== how_many_now
when: dead>=1
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: of_the_dead
A: How many is that now?
B: Too many. Watch the shadows.

== nobody_that_good
when: dead>=1
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: of_the_dead
A: Whoever it is, he's good.
B: Nobody's that good. We'll have him.

== found_another
when: dead>=1
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: of_the_dead
A: They found another one.
B [whispers]: Keep your voice down.

== throat_cut
when: dead>=1
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: of_the_dead
A: They found {dead}. Throat cut, they say.
B: Keep your voice down.

== owed_me_money
when: dead>=1
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: of_the_dead
A: {dead} owed me money.
B: Then you'd best find who did it.

== not_another_night
when: dread>=0.35
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: dread
A: I'm not staying another night here.
B: Nor me. Stay close.

== hearing_footsteps
when: dread>=0.35
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: dread
A: I keep hearing footsteps.
B: That's me, you fool.

== killed_the_captain
when: captain_dead
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: They killed the captain.
B: Then we make them pay for it.

== eyes_open
when: alarm>=0.45
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: alarm
A: Eyes open. He's still in here somewhere.
B: I know, I know.

== where_i_can_see_you
when: alarm>=0.45
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: alarm
A: Stay where I can see you.
B: Likewise.

== habit_turtle
when: habit:turtle
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: They say he hides behind his blade.
B: Then put a boot through it.

== habit_spam
when: habit:spam
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Swings like a butcher, they say.
B: Then let him tire, and cut him down.

== habit_kite
when: habit:kite
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: He runs. Won't stand and fight.
B: Then we'll run him down.

== habit_bow
when: habit:bow
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: He's got a bow. Keep out of the light.
B: And off the open ground.

== habit_parry
when: habit:parry
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: He turns every blow aside, they say.
B: Then feint. Make him guess.

== habit_dodge
when: habit:dodge
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Quick on his feet, that one.
B: Then go for his legs.

== anyone_seen
when: missing
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
A: Anyone seen {missing}?
B: Not since he took his post.

== let_him_go
when: spared
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
group: spared
A: He had {spared} on his knees. And let him go.
B: Then he's soft. Or he's playing with us.

== walked_away
when: spared
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
group: spared
A: {spared} begged, and he walked away.
B: I'd not count on that twice.

== nobody_kneels
when: slain_begging
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
group: slain
A: {slain} begged him. On his knees. He cut him down anyway.
B: Then nobody kneels. Nobody.

== fight_to_the_last
when: slain_begging
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
group: slain
A: He killed {slain} while he was begging.
B: Then we fight to the last. All of us.
